    "sentence_translations": [
      "(6) Qian Duoduo Is Unhappy",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo wanted to go with her mom to see a movie, just the two of them, but her little brother also wanted to go.",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo said, “What movie do you want to see?”",
      "",
      "Her little brother said, “I want to see Ultraman. I want to see Tom and Jerry …”",
      "",
      "“The movie theater doesn’t have these movies right now,” Qian Duoduo said.",
      "",
      "“I want to go to the movie theater. I want to go to the movie theater with my mom and big sister!” her little brother said.",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo looked at her mom.",
      "",
      "Her mom said, “Does the movie theater have kids’ movies right now? Disney movies? How about we go together with your little brother?”",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo said, “But … I wanted to go with just you, the two of us.”",
      "",
      "“Mom said, “Next time, next time the two of us can go. You’re the big sister …”",
      "",
      "“You’re the big sister.” It was these four words again! Qian Duoduo was unhappy. She didn’t say anything."
    ]
